window.products.push({"id":960036,"name":"Yoolax Motorized Zebra Blinds Works with Alexa, Light Filtering Day and Night Dual Layer Sheer Shade Blinds Customized Size, Privacy Light Control Hor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":185.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kuaZLaczL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MATERIAL: the automatic blind is made of blackout polyester and sheer fabric that is designed to provide privacy while still allowing light to enter the room, 80% shading. Double layer zebra shade combines alternating sheer and solid fabric bands in horizontal stripes, by remote control adjusting the density of indoor light, isolate the external line of sight to ensure indoor privacy. Close blinds to block harmful UV rays. 50% open to enjoy soft indoor light. Open to enjoy indoor sunshine. SMART MOTOR: durable quality battery rechargeable motor, each full charge can work for about 3-5 months. Pair a solar panel, no need to worry about the charging issue. P412 Remote Battery Motor needs a hub (Suggest Yoolax Hub) to connect to Alexa and Google Assistant. Z425 Smart Motor can directly work with smart things and 5 versions' Alexa (Echo Plus 2nd Gen, Echo Show 2nd Gen, Echo Studio, Echo Show 10, Echo 4th Gen). Other versions of the Alexa device and Google Assistant need a hub. REMOTE CONTROL: 15 channel remote (Pair to P412 motor) can control 15 power shades separately and simultaneously. Choose channel 0 to control all motorized blinds at the same time. 16 channel remote (Pair to Z425 motor) can control 16 motorized shades. Procedures are set before delivery, it can be used directly after installation. There are videos to help you set it too. MADE TO ORDER: the electric blind is custom made, you will see a \"Customize Now\" button on the page. Custom width is 22\" to 98\" wide, custom length is 22\" to 120\" long. We will send an email to double confirm the size within 24 hours after receiving the order. Please buy several zebra shades in 1 single order if you want the fabric slats to line up with each other because they need to be produced in the same batch. Please buy a fabric sample if you are not sure which color to choose. LEAD TIME: dispatch in 3-5 working days after getting size confirmation. 5-8 working days for transportation. Each smart blind is made to order, can't be sold after a return. We appreciate customer precise measurement & careful orders, avoid return without quality issue. Yoolax offers a 2-year warranty on all our motors and remote controls, during which we will repair/replace them free of charge. Please contact us if there is any problem and we will help solve it until you are satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kuaZLaczL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoolax","source_asin":"B092VBHYRJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-960036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092VBHYRJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092VBHYRJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
