window.products.push({"id":960087,"name":"Premium Quality 600-TC 100% Egyptian Cotton Dark Gray King-Sheets Set, 4-Piece Long-Staple Best-Bedding Sheets for Bed, Breathable, Soft & Silky Satee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+qoEHwQ7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGHEST QUALITY BEST COTTON SHEETS - New Better & Improved Version - If you love luxury and durability of hotel bed sheets and the look of crisp pillow Shams, you’ll adore our Breathable King Sheets, 1000-thread-count. We use yarns made with 100% long staple Egyptian cotton and a gorgeous sateen weave. Our eco-friendly sheets retain softness for a lifetime and resist fading. Indulge in soft bed sheets with detailed hem, available in Twin, Twin XL, Full, Queen and Cal King sizes KING Size Luxury 4pc Bed Sheets Set - 1 Flat Sheet: 108\" W x 102\" L; 1 Fully Elasticized Fitted Sheet: 78\" W x 80\" L + 16\" Deep pocket on fitted sheet with superb all around elastic to fit low profile foam and tall mattresses and 2 King Pillow sHAMS: 20\" W x 36\" L. Highest quality dye materials are used for fade resistance. FEEL THE DIFFERENCE: If you're looking for very soft sheets you have found them! They're breathable, cool and super silky soft. The comfort of these sheets will have you coming back! They're softer than Microfiber and organic cotton sheets! Best for any room in your house - bedroom, guest room, kids room, RV, vacation home. Great gift idea for men and women, Moms and Dads, Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day and Christmas. CARE GUIDE: Machine wash in warm and tumble dry on low, do not bleach. When machine drying, never dry at high temperatures. If your dryer is adjustable, use the medium fan and spin speed. For bed linens it is important to remove from dryer before completely dry, gently fold then iron, if needed. Egyptian Cotton tends to soften up with washing, so allow the sheets a few washes to experience the silky softness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+qoEHwQ7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHESS BED","source_asin":"B08XY5MHPN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-960087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XY5MHPN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XY5MHPN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
