window.products.push({"id":960096,"name":"21st birthday decorations|21st Birthday Decorations for her|Rose Gold 21st Birthday Decorations WITH Photo Booth Backdrop,Happy Birthday Banner,Confet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BL6K9V7XL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Happy birthday! From happy birthday banner to foil curtain, cake topper and a multitude of balloons, everything is extravagant and leaves everyone with beautiful memories! What's in the package? ⭐ 1x Number \"21\" 32 Inch Glittery Foil Balloons ⭐ 1× 40 Inch Champagne & Glass Foil Balloons ⭐ 1x Happy Birthday Banner ⭐ 2x 18 Inch Rose Gold Heart Foil Balloons ⭐ 2x 18 Inch Rose Gold Star Foil Balloons ⭐ 2x 18 Inch Silver Star Foil Balloons ⭐ 6x 12 Inch Rose Gold Confetti Balloons ⭐ 12x 10 Inch Pearl White Latex Balloons ⭐ 12x 10 Inch Rose Gold Latex Balloons ⭐ 1x 21st Birthday Cake Topper ⭐ 1x 21st Birthday Sash ⭐ 3x 10m Curling Ribbons FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS (FAQs) Do I need helium for the foil and latex balloons? Helium is optional, it will help the Number “21” and Foil Balloons, Latex Balloons to float.(Note: These Foil  Balloons do not float, hence only inflate with air).However, if you wish to save on the helium cost, you may inflate them all with air and hang them around the party venue and still look gorgeous! Does the Happy Birthday Banner need to be assembled? Yes, very easy to assemble birthday banners. We’ve included a pin in the pack, ribbon for hanging the letters!It takes 2-5 minutes to assemble the birthday banner Is there enough ribbon for all the balloons? We’ve included 99 Feet of Rose gold Ribbon that will be enough for all the balloons. How long do the balloons stay inflated? (When to inflate the balloons?) Number “21” Foil Balloons: 2 - 5 days, up to weeks (best on the same day) Happy Birthday Banner: Can be reused (best on the same day Confetti Balloons: 4 – 7 hours (best 2 – 3 hours before the party) Other Latex Balloons: Apprx. 10 – 12 hours (best 2 – 3 hours before the party)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BL6K9V7XL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aoketo","source_asin":"B088K4XGYY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-960096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088K4XGYY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088K4XGYY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
