window.products.push({"id":960533,"name":"Airee Fairee Toilet Brush and Holder Brushes Set Stainless Steel 2 Pack Free Standing Compact Modern Design Long Handle (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JaVL7ygRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY: We work closely with our dedicated manufacturers to ensure we provide the best possible product before we put it on the market. MODERN DESIGN: Our Toilet Brush and Holder are designed to hygienically keep your toilet clean whilst blending in with any bathroom. They fit well with any décor and can be discreetly placed by the toilet. HIGH QUALITY BRUSH: The Brush is long and thick, complete with high quality bristles. These bristles help aid cleaning so your toilet can be kept spotless. They are densely packed together to enhance the effectiveness of the brush, making it easy to use. LONG HANDLE: All our toilet brushes have a long handle, making cleaning easy. They are long enough to reach the bottom of any toilet with ease. This makes your job quicker and easier, because nobody wants to spend any longer than necessary cleaning toilets! HYGIENIC DESIGN: This brush has a closed bottom holder, which lets you store the brush hygienically when it is not in use. It also makes sure that no bacteria, odour causing mould or mildew can escape. The brush slots nicely into the holder so it is secured firmly in place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JaVL7ygRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIREE FAIREE","source_asin":"B07SGWKJCQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-960533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SGWKJCQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SGWKJCQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":960534,"name":"Nespresso D150 Espresso Machine, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412SW595E8L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Nespresso has developed a unique extraction system specially adapted to capsules. It controls every vital setting when preparing a perfect espresso. Nespresso machines have been designed with renowned partners and designers, and bring out the taste and aromas of coffee by combining quality of design with ease of use. The Nespresso D150 machine is part of our classic line. Classic Line machines all have the capsule holder system that uses the traditional gesture for preparing an espresso. They are designed with clean, simple, box shaped lines. The D150 machine deploys technology essential for preparing an outstanding Espresso, and is exceptionally easy to use. Manual control of the amount of coffee in the cup. A high pressure pump (19 bars) extracts all the aromas and develops a smooth crema in the cup. A thermobloc which heats water to 187°and 196° during extraction and empties the remaining water after each use so that the water is fresh for each preparation. Removable steam nozzle for hot water and steam. Cups warming plate. Black and stainless steel ABS finish. A simple system with a capsule holder which perforates the capsule and soaks all the ground coffee to optimally filter the coffee. Removable water container (41 oz) Amazon.com If you're an espresso, cappuccino, and/or latte fancier with an aversion to messiness and a devotion to uncomplicated appliances, this is the espresso machine for you. Instead of requiring an operator to measure out and carefully tamp down ground coffee and then dispose of wet grounds, it uses capsules filled with exactly the amount of ground coffee needed for one cup of espresso (use two capsules for a larger cappuccino or latte). After use, simply discard the capsule, which won't spill grounds on the counter. Nespresso sends along 20 capsules of two varieties of coffee with the machine, and they offer additional capsules in nine varieties of coffee, including two decaffeinated, for sale on their Web site or by toll-free telephone order. Other features of the 12-by-8-by-11-1/2-inch, 1,200-watt machine: The plastic water reservoir (1-1/4 quarts, or 24 espressos) lifts off for easy filling; the steam wand/hot-water nozzle has a built-in frothing attachment for creating cappuccino and latte foam; and on top of the machine is a metal plate for prewarming cups. (Two espresso cups and saucers are included.) Cleaning the machine is simple, with clear instructions and a tool provided. --Fred Brack Editor's note: This item may arrive with water inside from the manufacturer's pressure test. This is a normal occurrence and doesn't point to a problem with the machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412SW595E8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nespresso","source_asin":"B0007S5OEW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-960534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007S5OEW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007S5OEW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
