window.products.push({"id":960623,"name":"GiftsRDecor Tabletop Fountain Yoga Meditation Near Hut and Water Falling Roof","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91++1VyDeZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for something for your Yoga or Meditation area? Or for a place where you want to feel peace and tranquility?Want an invigorating environment for your workout? Yes, then this is the table top fountain you are looking for.A beautiful design. The water in this fountain cascades from the hut's roof onto another roof and then onto another one before finally falling into a pot.The fountain also includes a lady figure stretching out and sitting on a stone structure. You can see a hut in the background. A LED light is also embedded at the base.The fountain part is made of poly-resin material and water container is made of durable plastic. Some assembly is required. Please refer to the instruction manual included with the fountain.We pride ourselves with Warranty and Support. Please contact us via Amazon.WARRANTY:6 months warranty for any water leaks.3 months warranty for water pump.SUPPORT:Full refund or free replacement if you received damaged product.Support for product related questions / issues.Replacement parts.QUICK TIPS:Tip #1: Read the instruction manual for assembly, operation and troubleshooting.Tip #2: Make sure the fountain pump is properly immersed in water. See the instruction manual.Tip #3: All pumps are tested for quality assurance. If you hear pump noise then it is because the pump is not properly immersed in water (try putting in more water, refer to instructional manual) or not properly placed / laying flat inside the fountain (try place adjusting the pump slowly in the fountain until pump noise goes away completely).Tip #4: Note that water pumps do not come with on/off switch.Tip #5: Note that the LED connection needs to stay outside water container. See the instruction manual.Tip #6: This is an electric fountain.Tip #7: Relax and enjoy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91++1VyDeZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GiftsRDecor","source_asin":"B07G51N2T1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-960623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G51N2T1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G51N2T1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
