window.products.push({"id":960678,"name":"Metal Food Grinder Attachment for KitchenAid Stand Mixers, Meat Grinder includes 2 Sausage Stuffer Tubes, 3 Grinding Blades,3 Grinding Plates Meat Pro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+AVdHr9pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Features: 3 sharp blades will ensure the grinding speed, cut the meat faster and better. Stainless Steel Grind blade work faster, Both sides of the blade can be used, do not worry about misplaced blade. 2 different caliber sausage filling tubes can help you make the sausage you want, breakfast sausage, German sausage and more. How to Make Sausage: Highly recommend following steps to stuff sausage: No Need to Grind Meat double times, Only One Time! From grinding meat directly to stuffing sausage at the same time. 1. Cut raw meat to short narrow cubes 2. Mix Sausage seasonings and other ingredients together with the cut meat 3. Freeze the Mixed meat with seasonings for a while, or just put it aside for a few minutes to let water drained. 4. Then put the waterless or partially frozen meat on food tray to stuff sausage directly. How to clean: Like other common aluminum kitchen wares, this attachment Not Dishwasher Safe! Need Hand Wash Only! Clean soon after use, just put all parts in warm, soapy water for a few minutes, then clean it by soft cleaning brush or cloth. Rinse and dry them thoroughly after wash, in order to keep them not discolor and stay in peak condition. Package included: 1 x Meat grinder attachment for KitchenAid 3 x Grinding blades 3 x Grinding Plates 2 x Sausage Filling Tubes 1 x Food Pusher 1 x Cleaning Brush 1 x Food tray Kindly Tips: 1. You need to tighten the ring of the food grinder, It will help smooth the grinding. AND the handle of the food pusher will help. 2. You need to cut the meat into cubes or strips and freeze it a little, which will help to grind. 3. If you have any question, please feel free contact us. We provide 24-hour customer service. If by any chance your shipment arrives damaged, we will send you a replacement for free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+AVdHr9pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PROLIFE","source_asin":"B086TYL544","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-960678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086TYL544","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086TYL544","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
