window.products.push({"id":960717,"name":"NOVICA Handcrafted Floral Reverse Painted Glass and Wood Framed Wall Mirror, Purple Summer Garden'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z72AIyPUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer.  About this item: Summer dragonflies alight in a purple garden, beautifully depicted by Peruvian master artisan Gelacio Girón. This exquisite wall mirror is crafted in the time-honored tradition of Cajamarca. The artisan paints the motifs on the reverse side of glass, achieving a jewel-like clarity of color. Gilt adorns the borders.    Frame: 10.0\" H x 8.0\" W x 0.4\" D    Mirror: 3.7\" W x 5.25\" H  - Designed to hang vertically only   About our Artist: Peru's Gelacio Giron says, 'I showed talent for the arts while still in school, and began to sell my woodwork and painted glass through an artisan cooperative. In 1997, I formed an association of craftspeople dedicated to Peruvian arts, and work with my three brothers in our own workshop. I feel very content that my work is appreciated in people's homes, and I share this happiness with my family.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z72AIyPUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B00FN4NVSG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-960717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FN4NVSG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FN4NVSG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
