window.products.push({"id":960813,"name":"Traditional asian white rice pattern rice bowl - set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31F8R86Y60L._AC_.jpg","description":"Our basic white porcelain rice bowl has a Zen like simplicity. Aside from chopsticks, the 4\" rice bowl is perhaps the most ubiquitous dining tool in China. Historically, in China's rural expanses, a dining table was a luxury item. So the populace commonly uses a small rice bowl that fits easily in the palm of the hand. The 4\" bowl is perfect for noodle or rice dishes. The subtle pattern on the bowl is created by grains of rice that are left in the porcelain mold before the bowl is fired. In the kiln the rice disintegrates and leaves tiny windows of thin, almost translucent, porcelain in the body of the bowl. It is a simple production method that has elevated Chinese dinnerware from the plain to the ornate for centuries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31F8R86Y60L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reorient","source_asin":"B000CEY5UU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-960813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000CEY5UU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000CEY5UU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
