window.products.push({"id":960838,"name":"Regal Flame 1 Quart Bio-Ethanol Fireplace Fuel 12 Bottles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aEsiClWdL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Enjoy Regal Flame unique premium ethanol fireplace fuel developed completely from renewable resources. Regal Flame Bio Ethanol Fireplace Fuel is proudly made in the USA. Regal Flame fuel is cleanest burning bio ethanol fuel and is designed for ventless fireplaces. It is vent-free, non-toxic, smokeless, odorless and environmentally friendly fireplace fuel. This fuel burns clean, producing only CO2 and steam (humidity) in similar proportions as that exhaled by humans. Humidity is actually beneficial to lungs. Regal Flame Premium Fuel is rigorously consistently tested to ensure that air quality complies with the strict international government regulations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aEsiClWdL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moda Flame","source_asin":"B00GPU8ZZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-960838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GPU8ZZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GPU8ZZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":960839,"name":"Empress Silk Satin Sheet Set - King Set - Blush","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jc0wR9ntL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pure silk in satin weave creates the luxurious look and feel of these sheet sets. The fabric face is a classic silk satin most often recognized for its incredible smoothness and natural sheen while the fabric back is a softly subtle textured silk crepe. A gentle sand washing process further enhances the incredible softness. These sheets are woven using a high-end 19 momme weight silk fabric, are seamless and finished with a 4� decorative hem. The pillowcases incorporate generous French envelop, which covers the pillow at the open end. The fitted sheet has deep pockets and reinforced elastic throughout to ensure a proper fit on mattresses up to 17� Sizes: Queen, King, California King. Set includes one flat, one fitted and two pillowcases. Care: Machine washable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jc0wR9ntL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Empress Silk","source_asin":"B07C4Z7WX2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-960839","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C4Z7WX2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C4Z7WX2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
